    en: 'We had a lovely week at this house. The garden was beautiful and pleasant, offering stunning views. We particularly enjoyed the easy access to the lagoon, which made our stay even more special. The staff were incredibly nice and helpful, ensuring we had everything we needed. We highly recommend this place for a relaxing getaway.',
