    en: 'We had a great time in Sesimbra. DolceStay was the perfect place for us. We could walk anywhere from here. Great bakery and small supermarket with all that was needed just around the corner. Short walk to the beach, the market, restaurants, coffee shops. The house matches the description and was perfect for our holiday. The balcony and the big windows and doors were lovely — such a nice moment when we had our coffee in the morning looking outside. We would definitely come back. The hosts were super friendly and helpful. Communication was perfect.',
