    en: 'We had a wonderful stay at this Airbnb. The place is absolutely spotless and very well equipped, making it perfect for a longer stay. We stayed as a family for a few weeks and truly felt right at home from the moment we arrived. The team was incredibly welcoming, professional, and friendly throughout our stay. They were always responsive and quick to assist with anything we needed. We genuinely enjoyed our stay and would happily return.',
